<<<
doct(o)ress. It is a serious inconvenience that neither form (-iress would be the better) has been brought into any but facetious use as a prefixed title; the device of inserting a Christian name after Doctor (Dr Mary Jones) is clumsy, & sometimes (Dr Evelyn Jones) ineffectual. See FEMININE DESIGNA- TIONS.
===
**doct(o)ress.** It is a serious inconvenience that neither form (-tress would be the better) has been brought into any but facetious use as a prefixed title; the device of inserting a Christian name after Doctor *(Dr Mary Jones)* is clumsy, & sometimes *(Dr Evelyn Jones)* ineffectual. See ^^FEMININE DESIGNATIONS^^.
>>>

