<<<
document. It is sometimes forgotten that the word includes more than the parchments or separate papers to which it is usually applied; a coin, picture, monument, passage in a book &c., that serves as evidence, may be a d., & the following remark on ‘ Dd. illustrative of the Continental Reformation’? is ab-
